# External reference docs from the agent-john workspace.
# These are technical-investigation write-ups that travel with
# the dev environment (the agent's `/workspace` mount) rather than
# the code itself. They live in `archive/docs/` for local reference
# and are NOT tracked in git. To update them, replace the files in
# `archive/docs/` from the latest copy in the agent's workspace.
# See `archive/README.md` for the full archive contents.
archive/docs/MINIMAX-T2A-FINDINGS.md
archive/docs/TELEGRAM-VOICE-ECHO-FINDINGS.md
archive/docs/CODE-FLOW.md
archive/docs/PI-TELEGRAM-BRIDGE-NOTES.md

# scripts/README.md — documents the dev tools (dev-status.sh, dev-watch.sh)
# that are NOT in the npm package (the runtime scripts are tts-minimax.mjs
# etc., which ARE in the package). Excluding it from git/npm also stops
# npm's "always include README variants" rule from pulling it into the
# tarball via the `files` whitelist.
scripts/README.md
